  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p>Statement I : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> both possess V-shaped structure</p><p>Statement II : The bond angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is less than that of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "E3NbZ",
      "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
